B.T7=s(["Tap an exercise on the Home screen, or go to Exercises and tap any exercise.","Adjust weight, reps, and/or time with the +/\u2212 buttons. Tap the number to type directly.","Optionally set RPE \u2014 your effort for that set (1 = very easy, 10 = absolute max).","Tap SAVE. A rest timer starts automatically; use the chips to change its duration.","Repeat for each set. All sets logged today are shown at the bottom of the screen."],t.s)
